sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    box WebSocket Service 1
        participant Reg1 as Registry
    end

    participant Redis as Redis

    box WS Gateway / WebSocket Service 2
        participant Watcher as Membership Watcher
        participant Ring as Hash Ring
    end

    Note over Reg1, Ring: 1. 부팅 시 등록 및 초기 reconcile
    Reg1->>Redis: SET wss:member:addr EX 30
    Watcher->>Redis: PSUBSCRIBE __keyspace@0__:wss:member:*
    Watcher->>Redis: SCAN wss:member:*
    Redis-->>Watcher: 현재 멤버 목록
    Watcher->>Ring: Set(addrs)

    Note over Reg1, Ring: 2. 정상 운영 (heartbeat + keyspace 이벤트)
    loop 10초마다
        Reg1->>Redis: EXPIRE wss:member:addr 30
    end

    Reg1->>Redis: SET (또는 신규 인스턴스 SET)
    Redis-->>Watcher: keyspace notification
    Watcher->>Redis: SCAN
    Redis-->>Watcher: 현재 멤버 목록
    Watcher->>Ring: Set(addrs)

    Note over Reg1, Ring: 3. 30초 ticker 안전망 (notification 누락 대비)
    loop 30초마다
        Watcher->>Redis: SCAN
        Redis-->>Watcher: 현재 멤버 목록
        Watcher->>Ring: Set(addrs)
    end

    Note over Reg1, Ring: 4. graceful 종료
    Reg1->>Redis: DEL wss:member:addr
    Redis-->>Watcher: keyspace notification (del)
    Watcher->>Redis: SCAN
    Watcher->>Ring: Set(addrs - removed)

    Note over Reg1, Ring: 5. ungraceful (heartbeat 누락 30초 후 자동 expire)
    Note over Redis: TTL 만료 → expired 이벤트
    Redis-->>Watcher: keyspace notification (expired)
    Watcher->>Redis: SCAN
    Watcher->>Ring: Set(addrs - expired)
